        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Oenanthotoxin\n- Plants: Costus, Oenanthe\n- Concepts: plant families, Apiaceae\n\nFacts:\n- Oenanthotoxin is extracted from plants of the genus Oenanthe.\n- Oenanthe belongs to the family Apiaceae.\n- Costus is a plant genus that is not in the family Apiaceae.\n- Costus and the plant type that Oenanthotoxin is extracted from are not both in the family Apiaceae.",
